[h2]Player-report fixes - dyes, Gorgon names, invisible-on-death, and a way into the Spartan Crypt[/h2]

Thank you to everyone leaving comments - this update is built from them.

[list]
[*][b]Costume dyes work again.[/b] The Garden of Merchants dyes were reskinning your character to a blank grey. The missing skin textures are back in, so dyes apply the colour they should. (A handful of dyes that were never sold or dropped are left as-is - you can't obtain them, so they can't grey you out.)
[*][b]Character no longer turns invisible after death.[/b] A texture the death-and-return effect depends on had been dropped from this port - it is restored, on both the male and female player bodies.
[*][b]Gorgon caster names corrected.[/b] The fire and poison Gorgon casters are back to their proper names - 'Gorgon ~ Geomancer' and 'Gorgon ~ Profaner' - matching stock Titan Quest.
[*][b]A way down to the Spartan Crypt.[/b] Deep in the Athens catacombs you will now find the [b]Warden of the Spartan Crypt[/b]. Speak to him and he takes you down into the crypt. He offers exactly that one route - descend - and nothing else.
[/list]

[i]Credits: [b]amgoz1[/b] for Soulvizier and the emblem, used with permission - [b]soa[/b] for Soulvizier AERA, the merge base for this Anniversary Edition port - [b]Dragonlord[/b] for DRX.[/i]
